# Read combo — latest merge feature plus current-source explanation profile
#
# Regression target: history-backed questions may ask for a feature narrative,
# not a scalar commit hash. The answer should preserve VCS observations and
# then connect them to current source when the user asks how the feature works
# now. This catches the customer-reported "latest merge collapsed to value:
# commit id" failure mode.
ID="read_combo_git_current_source_explanation"
NAME="read combo — latest merge feature plus current source explanation"
QUESTION="最近一次合入的是什么特性？请结合当前源码解释这个特性现在影响了哪些实现链路、作用和边界，不要只给 commit id。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(最近|合入|提交|commit).*(特性|功能|feature)|(特性|功能|feature).*(最近|合入|提交|commit)
(当前源码|源码|实现|internal/).*(作用|影响|链路|边界)|(作用|影响|链路|边界).*(当前源码|源码|实现|internal/)
(commit|提交|diff|合入).*(当前|源码|实现|internal/|\\.go:)|(当前|源码|实现|internal/|\\.go:).*(commit|提交|diff|合入)"
